    <div id="page-content" class="page-content">
        <main id="top">
            <div class="about-brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src="/images/logo.webp" alt="" class="about-brand-logo">
            </div>
            <section class="about-intro reveal" aria-labelledby="about-title">
                <div class="about-photo-wrap">
                    <img src="/images/silvia.webp" alt="Silvia smiling" class="about-photo">
                </div>
                <div class="about-heading">
                    <h1 id="about-title">Hi, I'm Silvia!</h1>
                    <h2>Welcome to my world made of numbers, deep awareness and energy.</h2>
                    <p>My name is Silvia and my professional story began with a degree in Education Sciences. For many years I worked closely with families and children, but it was with the birth of my daughter that something inside me went through a true blossoming.</p>
                    <p>From this personal transformation came the <b>Mappa della Fioritura</b>: a tool of love and discovery that uses the Destiny Matrix and date of birth to help adults and young people deeply understand their own identity, their talents and their relationship dynamics.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="numbers-reiki reveal" aria-labelledby="numbers-reiki-title">
                <h2 id="numbers-reiki-title">The bond between Numbers and Reiki</h2>
                <blockquote>
                    <p>If the Destiny Matrix is the map that shows us who we are and where we are going, Reiki is the breath of energy that supports us on the journey.</p>
                </blockquote>
            </section>

            <section class="integrated-path reveal" aria-label="Integrated path">
                <p class="integrated-path-intro">Working with people I realized that mental awareness alone is sometimes not enough: blocks, fears and conditioning also live in our energetic body. That's why I integrated Reiki treatments into my sessions:</p>

                <div class="path-cards">
                    <article class="path-card path-card-matrix">
                        <h2>With the Matrix</h2>
                        <p>We bring light and clarity to your patterns and your potential.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="path-card path-card-reiki">
                        <h2>Reiki</h2>
                        <p>We rebalance the energy field, releasing tension so you can truly ground that awareness into your daily life.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="about-closing reveal" aria-label="Invitation to calculate your Matrix">
                <p>Whether you're here to discover your evolutionary map, to rebalance your energy or to bring harmony to your family relationships, I'm here to accompany you to bloom into your most authentic version of yourself.</p>
                <a href="/en/index.html" class="about-closing-link">Calculate your Matrix</a>
            </section>
        </main>
    </div>
</div>
